# Concealing Curtains: "When this creature transforms into Revealing Eye" is about this creature only. Bot1 has two
# Curtains. On turn 3 the first transforms: Bot2's hand is revealed and Bot1 takes Lightning Bolt (Bot2 draws a card in
# its place). The second then transforms: the first Eye does not trigger again for it - one reveal, and Bot1 chooses
# nothing ("you may"), so Bot2 keeps Counterspell. Black Lotus pays for the second transformation.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Concealing Curtains
Concealing Curtains
Black Lotus
Swamp
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt
Counterspell
Island x12

